/P 181 0 R
/E (Over the summer, our E-Board worked hard to restore our Pitt NSBE website! Our website has information all about our chapter and the initiatives we have planned for the semester. Check out our website for more information on our history, achievements, programs, volunteering opportunities, archived newsletters, and more!)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
